  "content": "[Intro]\n[D]\n[D7M]\n[D7]\n[G]  [Gm]\n[A]\n[D]\n[D7M]\n[D7]\n[G]  [Gm]\n[A]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D]You had gone\n[A/C#]and you\n[Bm]Left me standing there\n[A]alone again\n[G]And the sea-\n[A]sons turn and change\n[D]The broken clock\n[A/C#]And the\n[Bm]bitter sweet smell of\n[A]the wind of change\n[G]Not the same\n[A]here without you\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Bm]\nI know I have\n[F#/A#]to keep my head\nI know I have\n[Asus2add13]to rise above\nThough it's so hard\n[E]\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]I [A]\nGonna\n[D]make it all [B]alone\nBut since you\n[E]went away The [A]time\nis standing still\n\n[Pre-Verse]\n[Bm]  [F#/A#]\n[Asus2add13]\n[E]\n[G]\n[A]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[D]The road side\n[A/C#]Staring\n[Bm]at the lights as cars\n[A]go passing by\n[G]Hands in po-\n[A]ckets kicking cans\n[D]I lost you\n[A/C#]But I\n[Bm]still feel some of the\n[A]warmth you left here\n[G]Tears don't come,\n[A]wish I could cry\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[D]\nWe had some good\n[A/C#]times and some bad\nMy memory cuts\n[Cm/A]me like a knife\nShiny and cru-\n[E]el\n[F#]\n\n[Chorus]\n[G]I [A]\nGonna\n[D]make it all [B]alone\nBut since you\n[E]went away The [A]time\nis standing still\n[D]  [E]  [F#]\n[G]I [A]\nGonna\n[D]make it all [B]alone\nBut since you\n[E]went away The [A]time\nis standing still\n\n[Solo]\n[D]\n[D7M]\n[D7]\n[G]Standing [Gm]still\n[A]\n[Bm]\n[F#/A#]\n[Asus2add13]\n[E]But I'm [G]\nstill stan-\n[F#]ding\n\n[Outro]\n[E]\n[B]",
